n\n\n\n構図などはお任せしたいです！\n\n以上となります。\nよろしくお願いします！\n\nhttps://www.dropbox.com/scl/fo/9n95ysq8sxwp597292lto/h?rlkey=ji7uv8xj47ruad8ybx78iebdt&dl=0", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@_Pizarrokun/works/10", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/99357372/uploads/origins/ce7ad212-b502-4377-b32f-1399c4c19144?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=9755bd5566fe568d3adaa20053f4b8a9", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/99357372/uploads/origins/ce7ad212-b502-4377-b32f-1399c4c19144?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=9755bd5566fe568d3adaa20053f4b8a9, https://si.imgix.net/99357372/uploads/origins/ce7ad212-b502-4377-b32f-1399c4c19144?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=977283fd22fb5e87d2aaf757f4767eb5 2x, https://si.imgix.net/99357372/uploads/origins/ce7ad212-b502-4377-b32f-1399c4c19144?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=2f4e4548c6589ba43fd38090baebd459 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "いつもお世話になってます。\n今回はビキニ水着を着て海で遊ぶウェンティをお願いします！\n波打ち際で水をバシャンってしてる感じでお願いします。\n残念ボク男でした～っていうセリフを入れてください。", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@_Pizarrokun/works/9", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/41f634ed/uploads/origins/728c8eea-2a96-4d7a-bbc7-20758bed0c19?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=ddfa053277d904e6005d0f2c0283bcd5", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/41f634ed/uploads/origins/728c8eea-2a96-4d7a-bbc7-20758bed0c19?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=ddfa053277d904e6005d0f2c0283bcd5, https://si.imgix.net/41f634ed/uploads/origins/728c8eea-2a96-4d7a-bbc7-20758bed0c19?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=bd5e12414116c1753cc2725e4c1c02ca 2x, https://si.imgix.net/41f634ed/uploads/origins/728c8eea-2a96-4d7a-bbc7-20758bed0c19?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&